{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this wholesome community-focused bonanza, you\u2019re tasked with restoring color to the sky island of Cloudtopia! The first and only order of business will be to drum up as much chaos as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084840/extras/bb68ca0aaeb169aafcdb3dcdf92359ca.poster.avif?t=1757526023\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084840/extras/bb68ca0aaeb169aafcdb3dcdf92359ca.webm?t=1757526023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084840/extras/bb68ca0aaeb169aafcdb3dcdf92359ca.mp4?t=1757526023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll achieve this by generating magic from the joyful variety of infinitely-replayable puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084840/extras/c40ccdc1df7e9380714cdd39eee00efa.poster.avif?t=1757526023\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084840/extras/c40ccdc1df7e9380714cdd39eee00efa.webm?t=1757526023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084840/extras/c40ccdc1df7e9380714cdd39eee00efa.mp4?t=1757526023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, as always, you'll have a squad of loyal friends to help spice things up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" pos